  "review_findings": [
    "All 8 changed paths reviewed. The source changes remove only the exact early Foundry DTO module and the three-string GeneratedSchemaModule placeholder; no fields were copied into a new owner.",
    "The compatibility alias remains and preserves object identity for CompatibilityMode, SchemaRegistry, and SchemaVersion. Foundry plugin SimulationConfig remains the actual plugin type.",
    "The scanner v2 tests exercise module-file, package-initializer, and package-resource candidates, a restored-package negative import control, outside-root rejection, and partial unreadable-input behavior.",
    "The source census is a pre-removal snapshot bound to slice-base tracked inputs; it is not represented as a post-removal tree census. It read 13,678 of 13,678 selected full-tree UTF-8 inputs from 13,773 tracked paths and 13,651 selected product-root inputs from 13,745 paths. Its 320 unresolved nonliteral loader destinations (558 literal; 878 total) in both the full-tree and product-root current census views remain unresolved.",
    "The release-fragment checker exited 1 with two Lex fragment public-surface errors; the DFK fragment had no findings/errors. No base replay/full-input disjointness proof was performed, so P41 attribution for those errors is not_established.",
    "Hatchling was unavailable in the review environment; wheel/sdist build and installed-package membership remain UNRUN. External clients and persisted historical payloads remain not_established.",
    "The final a13 delta only changes the test fixture from unlink to a byte-preserving rename and assertion. That exact test passed independently on the final candidate; source/runtime checks from bd4 carry because the only intervening candidate change is this test-only diff."
